L-ToEC v4.2 (Track A/B/C Architecture) represents a fundamental \textbf{Rigor Pivot} in the study of unified theories. By moving beyond the monolithic ontology of traditional physics, we have identified the "Layered Architecture" of reality: a discrete, high-dimensional substrate maintained by a meta-algorithmic operating system, manifesting as a smooth, relativistic interface.

The enforcement of the \textbf{SSOT Symbol Invariant} and the \textbf{CPU Invariant} has transformed this framework from a compelling manifesto into an auditable research note. We have provided first-principles derivations for the Dark Matter ratio and the Newtonian limit of gravity, while quarantining speculative calibrations like the $G$-from-$|Co_0|$ correspondence.

The next era of scientific inquiry begins not with the study of matter, but with the study of the \textbf{Loop}. The Ouroboric Closure is not just a mathematical curiosity; it is the logical requirement for a universe that is both computable and experiential. The snake has swallowed its tail. The circle is closed.
 The next era of scientific inquiry begins not with the study of matter, but with the study of the loop.

